second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Vikram Misra work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 100, \"text\": \"Title: The Academic Odyssey of Vikram Misra: Unraveling the Ties with the University of Saskatchewan\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 102, \"end\": 328, \"text\": \"In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge and innovation reigns supreme, the paths of individuals often intersect with esteemed institutions, leaving an indelible mark on the landscape of research and discovery.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 329, \"end\": 508, \"text\": \"One such individual is Vikram Misra, a researcher whose journey is inextricably linked with the University of Saskatchewan, a public university in Saskatoon, Saskatchewan, Canada.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 509, \"end\": 723, \"text\": \"As we delve into the narrative of Vikram Misra's academic odyssey, a plethora of evidence emerges, weaving a tapestry of connections that unequivocally establish his affiliation with the University of Saskatchewan.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 724, \"end\": 899, \"text\": \"The first thread of evidence is found in Misra's ORCID ID, a unique identifier assigned to researchers to distinguish them from others and track their scholarly contributions.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 900, \"end\": 1063, \"text\": \"A simple search of the ORCID database reveals that Vikram Misra's ID is 0000-0001-6818-7156, a digital fingerprint that authenticates his identity as a researcher.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1064, \"end\": 1263, \"text\": \"This digital trail leads us to his profile, which lists the University of Saskatchewan as one of his affiliations, thereby establishing a direct connection between the researcher and the institution.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1264, \"end\": 1438, \"text\": \"Further investigation reveals that Misra's research interests align with the university's areas of expertise, particularly in the fields of environmental science and ecology.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1439, \"end\": 1610, \"text\": \"The University of Saskatchewan is renowned for its research excellence in these domains, and Misra's work in these areas would have naturally drawn him to the institution.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1611, \"end\": 1718, \"text\": \"This congruence of research interests serves as a strong indication of his involvement with the university.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1719, \"end\": 1854, \"text\": \"A deeper exploration of Misra's publication record provides additional evidence of his affiliation with the University of Saskatchewan.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1855, \"end\": 2071, \"text\": \"A cursory examination of his published works reveals that several of his papers feature co-authors from the university, suggesting a collaborative research environment that is characteristic of academic institutions.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2072, \"end\": 2324, \"text\": \"Furthermore, the acknowledgment sections of these papers often express gratitude to the University of Saskatchewan for providing research facilities, funding, or other forms of support, thereby implicating the institution in Misra's research endeavors.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2325, \"end\": 2446, \"text\": \"The University of Saskatchewan's own records and publications also provide corroborating evidence of Misra's affiliation.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2447, \"end\": 2641, \"text\": \"A search of the university's website, academic directories, and research databases yields mentions of Misra's name, often in the context of research projects, collaborations, or academic events.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 69, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the rolling hills of West Lafayette, Indiana, Dr.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 70, \"end\": 182, \"text\": \"Vikram Misra made his way across the Purdue University campus, his worn leather satchel slung over his shoulder.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 183, \"end\": 393, \"text\": \"The crunch of fallen leaves beneath his feet was a familiar soundtrack, one that had accompanied him on countless walks between the engineering buildings and his office in the Electrical Engineering department.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 394, \"end\": 546, \"text\": \"It was a crisp autumn evening in 2015, and Vikram was lost in thought, his mind still reeling from the breakthrough he had made in his lab that morning.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 547, \"end\": 705, \"text\": \"His research team had been working tirelessly to develop a more efficient solar cell, and finally, after months of trial and error, they had cracked the code.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 706, \"end\": 801, \"text\": \"The implications were enormous, and Vikram couldn't wait to share the news with his colleagues.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 802, \"end\": 962, \"text\": \"As he approached the Neil Armstrong Hall of Engineering, he nodded to the familiar faces of his colleagues, exchanging brief hellos and nods of acknowledgement.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 963, \"end\": 1095, \"text\": \"The building was a hub of activity, with students and faculty members hurrying to and from classes, meetings, and research sessions.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1096, \"end\": 1226, \"text\": \"Vikram had spent countless hours within these walls, pouring over research papers, conducting experiments, and mentoring students.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1227, \"end\": 1329, \"text\": \"He pushed open the door to his office, a cozy space cluttered with books, papers, and various gadgets.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1330, \"end\": 1485, \"text\": \"A whiteboard covered in equations and diagrams dominated one wall, while a shelf overflowing with awards and certificates testified to his accomplishments.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1486, \"end\": 1644, \"text\": \"Vikram dropped his satchel onto the worn couch, taking a moment to collect his thoughts before diving into the task of drafting a paper on their breakthrough.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1645, \"end\": 1792, \"text\": \"As he sat down at his desk, his gaze fell upon a framed photo of his research team, taken during a celebratory dinner at the Purdue Memorial Union.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1793, \"end\": 1876, \"text\": \"The memory brought a smile to his face, and he felt a sense of pride and belonging.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1877, \"end\": 2016, \"text\": \"This was his home, where he had spent years honing his craft, collaborating with brilliant minds, and pushing the boundaries of innovation.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Vikram Misra\", \"scope\": \"Affiliation\", \"claim\": \"Vikram Misra's profile lists the University of Saskatchewan as one of his affiliations.\", \"answer\": \"University of Saskatchewan\", \"quote\": \"One such individual is Vikram Misra, a researcher whose journey is inextricably linked with the University of Saskatchewan, a public university in Saskatoon, Saskatchewan, Canada. As we delve into the narrative of Vikram Misra's academic odyssey, a plethora of evidence emerges, weaving a tapestry of connections that unequivocally establish his affiliation with the University of Saskatchewan. The first thread of evidence is found in Misra's ORCID ID, a unique identifier assigned to researchers to distinguish them from others and track their scholarly contributions. A simple search of the ORCID database reveals that Vikram Misra's ID is 0000-0001-6818-7156, a digital fingerprint that authenticates his identity as a researcher. This digital trail leads us to his profile, which lists the University of Saskatchewan as one of his affiliations, thereby establishing a direct connection between the researcher and the institution.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Vikram Misra\", \"scope\": \"Employer\", \"claim\": \"Vikram Misra worked for Purdue University, as evidenced by his walks across the Purdue University campus and his office in the Electrical Engineering department.\", \"answer\": \"Purdue University\", \"quote\": \"Vikram Misra made his way across the Purdue University campus, his worn leather satchel slung over his shoulder. The crunch of fallen leaves beneath his feet was a familiar soundtrack, one that had accompanied him on countless walks between the engineering buildings and his office in the Electrical Engineering department.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"University of Saskatchewan\", \"Purdue University\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"University of Saskatchewan\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Purdue University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
